#: ../../source/docs/git-branch.rst:5 d5a2af3886d44bd6be6f4371cdd54cb8
msgid "Branching and Committing"
msgstr "分支与提交"

#: ../../source/docs/git-branch.rst:7 a0a06f38873b46eb87b3e7dff7a046b0
msgid ""
"**Branches** are a way to isolate different paths of development, which can "
"then be combined (aka \"merged\") into a single branch (often named "
"\"master\"). Refer to `this short guide "
"<http://gitready.com/beginner/2009/01/25/branching-and-merging.html>`__ or "
"the resources in the :ref:`Learning Git <where-to-get-the-"
"code_learning_git>` section for more information."
msgstr ""
"**分支** 是隔离不同开发路径的方式，这些路径随后可以合并（即「merge」）到单个分支（通常命名为「master」）。请参阅 `本简短指南 "
"<http://gitready.com/beginner/2009/01/25/branching-and-merging.html>`__ 或 "
":ref:`学习 Git <where-to-get-the-code_learning_git>` 部分中的资源以获取更多信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-branch.rst:11 17c104f08b544f8b89d53bb219d9bca7
msgid ""
"**Commits** record changes to the code along with a description and the "
"author's name."
msgstr "**提交** 记录代码更改，包含描述和作者姓名。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-branch.rst:13 7dd36267343b4391aed815b4533e79e0
msgid ""
"This page describes how to create a branch and add some commits. The "
"instructions show the command line interface but all of the "
":ref:`recommended GUI tools <git-install>` can also perform these functions."
msgstr ""
"本页介绍如何创建分支并添加一些提交。说明展示的是命令行界面，但所有 :ref:`推荐的 GUI 工具 <git-install>` 也可以执行这些功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-branch.rst:17 26a40da241fd4c5ab6ad44b30dad301e
msgid "Creating a Branch"
msgstr "创建分支"

#: ../../source/docs/git-branch.rst:19 2983a254c1ef4a50ad2c3952d570fcf4
msgid ""
"open a terminal window and cd to the ardupilot directory of your :ref:`clone"
" <git-clone>` and checkout the master branch"
msgstr "打开终端窗口，切换到 :ref:`克隆 <git-clone>` 的 ardupilot 目录，并检出 master 分支"

#: ../../source/docs/git-branch.rst:25 31a0834201ab42dea8060c907dd9fdb9
msgid ""
"the new branch will be a copy of the current branch so ensure your "
":ref:`clone's <git-clone>` master branch is up-to-date with (aka "
":ref:`rebased on <git-rebase>`) `ArduPilot/master "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot>`__. If you have just :ref:`forked "
"<git-fork>` and :ref:`cloned <git-clone>` your repo then it should already "
"be up-to-date."
msgstr ""
"新分支将是当前分支的副本，因此请确保您 :ref:`克隆 <git-clone>` 的 master 分支与 `ArduPilot/master "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot>`__ 保持同步（即 :ref:`变基于 <git-rebase>` "
"其上）。如果您刚刚 :ref:`fork <git-fork>` 并 :ref:`克隆 <git-clone>` 了您的仓库，那么它应该已经是最新的。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-branch.rst:28 76914e3cd5e54ff4baaff58154d3b428
msgid ""
"decide on a branch name and create the new branch.  The name is up to you "
"but it can be helpful to choose a short descriptive name. The branch name "
"used for this tutorial is \"ardupilot_git_tutorial\"."
msgstr ""
"确定分支名称并创建新分支。名称由您自定，但选择简短的描述性名称会很有帮助。本教程使用的分支名称为「ardupilot_git_tutorial」。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-branch.rst:34 65f7a55e3cb9401fb949798bf3b454c4
msgid ""
"Change some code. For this tutorial, open the "
"**Tools/GIT_Test/GIT_Success.txt** in your preferred text editor, and put "
"your name at the end of the file then save the file"
msgstr ""
"修改一些代码。在本教程中，用您偏好的文本编辑器打开 "
"**Tools/GIT_Test/GIT_Success.txt**，在文件末尾添加您的名字，然后保存文件"

#: ../../source/docs/git-branch.rst:38 ccba921083f14d528d5a811955003c20
msgid "See that you have changed the files by checking the status"
msgstr "通过检查状态确认您已修改了文件"

#: ../../source/docs/git-branch.rst:44 510f9f1acdf6416ba5f6b37b8fdae305
msgid ""
"**Stage** and **Commit** your work to the branch to record your changes to "
"your :ref:`clone <git-clone>`"
msgstr "将您的工作 **暂存** 并 **提交** 到分支，以在 :ref:`克隆 <git-clone>` 中记录您的更改"

#: ../../source/docs/git-branch.rst:51 cbceec9946314c159c90f9e5b7f9c1c0
msgid ""
"In this case, the subject line of the commit is simply \"Tools: added name "
"to GIT_Success.txt\" but see :ref:`here <submitting-patches-back-to-master>`"
" for more detailed information on conventions for commits that you expect to"
" be integrated into `ArduPilot/master "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot>`__."
msgstr ""
"在此情况下，提交的主题行简单地为「Tools: added name to GIT_Success.txt」，但对于您期望合并到 "
"`ArduPilot/master <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot>`__ 的提交规范，请参见 "
":ref:`此处 <submitting-patches-back-to-master>` 了解更详细的信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-branch.rst:55 3aa51fcb2c784c48952e350e015817f4
msgid ""
"**Push** the new branch from your local :ref:`clone <git-clone>` to your "
":ref:`fork <git-fork>` on GitHub. This will copy your work on your local "
"branch to a new branch on GitHub. Pushing branches is a precondition for "
"collaborating with others on GitHub or for submitting patches back to the "
"official releases.  It is assumed \"origin\" is the remote name of your "
":ref:`fork <git-fork>` on GitHub"
msgstr ""
"将新分支从您本地的 :ref:`克隆 <git-clone>` **推送** 到 GitHub 上您的 :ref:`fork <git-"
"fork>`。这会将您本地分支上的工作复制到 GitHub 上的新分支。推送分支是在 GitHub "
"上与他人协作或将补丁提交回官方版本的前提条件。假设「origin」是您在 GitHub 上 :ref:`fork <git-fork>` 的远程名称"

#: ../../source/docs/git-branch.rst:64 8c7e88a649004e6ca169db4d1fdcc94e
msgid ""
"Congratulations! This is bulk of the normal process you'd follow when "
"working on code to submit back to the official project. The next step is to "
":ref:`submit a pull request <submitting-patches-back-to-master>` so your "
"changes can be considered for addition to the main project."
msgstr ""
"恭喜！这是您向官方项目提交代码时通常遵循的主要流程。下一步是 :ref:`提交 PR（合并请求）<submitting-patches-back-to-"
"master>`，以便您的更改可以被考虑添加到主项目。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-branch.rst:70 27c2028726d14ad19b963fe9f6e1dcfc
msgid "GitHub GUI specific instructions"
msgstr "GitHub GUI 专项说明"

#: ../../source/docs/git-branch.rst:72 8eb609f4b6d849cba29e500801fa3c69
msgid ""
"In the Github GUI you used to clone the repository, you can create a branch "
"and commit it."
msgstr "在您用于克隆仓库的 GitHub GUI 中，您可以创建分支并提交。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-branch.rst:75 187cb522b8fa4701aac2a1326e9cd6c9
msgid ""
"Create a branch. In the GitHub for Windows application, click on the "
"'master' button in the upper right corner of the window."
msgstr "创建分支。在 GitHub for Windows 应用程序中，点击窗口右上角的「master」按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-branch.rst:81 cf43fe0f71fc4b979eea99a899416480
msgid ""
"Enter 'ardupilot_git_tutorial' and click the \"+ create branch: "
"ardupilot_git_tutorial\" dropdown."
msgstr ""
"输入「ardupilot_git_tutorial」并点击「+ create branch: ardupilot_git_tutorial」下拉菜单。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-branch.rst:87 b5063da976074e3cad6489326527569e
msgid "Create a new branch in Github for Windows"
msgstr "在 Github for Windows 中创建新分支"

#: ../../source/docs/git-branch.rst:89 eeb5a58c7a984caa882940dd0f6fa909
msgid ""
"Change some code. For this tutorial, open the "
"**Tools/GIT_Test/GIT_Success.txt** in your preferred text editor, and put "
"your name at the end of the file. Save the file."
msgstr ""
"修改一些代码。在本教程中，用您偏好的文本编辑器打开 "
"**Tools/GIT_Test/GIT_Success.txt**，在文件末尾添加您的名字。保存文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-branch.rst:93 50fb9e45911448f29c3dff65c7185ab2
msgid ""
"The Git for Windows client shows the changed file and has a place where you "
"can enter a summary and description of the change. For the purpose of this "
"tutorial, you can just use a single line stating: \"Tools: added name to "
"GIT_Success.txt\""
msgstr ""
"Git for Windows 客户端显示已更改的文件，并提供可输入更改摘要和描述的位置。就本教程而言，只需使用一行说明：「Tools: added "
"name to GIT_Success.txt」"

#: ../../source/docs/git-branch.rst:101 5596d36180894f6f9b5ef9d7189c078c
msgid "Github for windows: Commit Change"
msgstr "Github for Windows：提交更改"

#: ../../source/docs/git-branch.rst:107 52967d08bd334c54b08e45dab9de0fc0
msgid ""
"Please see :ref:`Submitting Patches Back to Master <submitting-patches-back-"
"to-master>` for further"
msgstr "请参阅 :ref:`将补丁提交回 Master <submitting-patches-back-to-master>` 以获取更多"

#: ../../source/docs/git-branch.rst:106 d5b35deb9c3c48b8a48a032e0d0e5c3e
msgid ""
"information regarding conventions for committing work that you expect to be "
"integrated into the official releases (this will include a much more "
"detailed commit message)."
msgstr "关于您希望集成到官方版本的工作的提交规范信息（这将包括更详细的提交消息）。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-branch.rst:110 cb45a173ef7642ab807c4ea6c91a56f3
msgid ""
"Commit your work to the branch by pressing the **Commit to "
"ardupilot_git_tutorial** link."
msgstr "按 **Commit to ardupilot_git_tutorial** 链接将您的工作提交到分支。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-branch.rst:112 e7f989d0344c439793bfd4f08a04a7a1
msgid ""
"Push your local branch to GitHub (pushing branches is a precondition for "
"collaborating with others on GitHub or for submitting patches back to the "
"official releases). In the client you can do this by pressing the "
"**Publish** link:"
msgstr ""
"将您的本地分支推送到 GitHub（推送分支是在 GitHub 上与他人协作或将补丁提交回官方版本的前提条件）。在客户端中，您可以按 "
"**Publish** 链接来执行此操作："

#: ../../source/docs/git-branch.rst:120 4cbdbc3aaf1949abb8c679226c36e7b6
msgid "GitHub for Windows Client: Pushing changes"
msgstr "GitHub for Windows 客户端：推送更改"
